morial to her at the New  Avengers headquarters or something like  that maybe in a post-credits scene or  they're going to show a scene in the  movie that's going to be really touching  something like maybe at the end of the  film she'll talk about finally retiring  maybe settling down falling in love and  it may be adopting some children since  we know that she can't have kids and  seeing a scene like that is definitely  going to be heart-wrenching because of  course we know that she's going to die  and we're not going to actually get to  see her have that life but no matter  what it is the great news is that we are  going to get some type of closure  according to Scarlett Johansson herself  in the Black Widow film not a funeral  because Natasha wouldn't have wanted  that but some closure so let me know  what you think about this what do you  think about Natasha not getting a  funeral because she wouldn't have wanted  one and what do you think we're going to  see as far as this new grieving scene in  the Black Widow film let me know your  thoughts in the comments down below and  don't forget to like this video and  subscribe to stay up-to-date on all  things relating to the MCU for live  updates  can follow me on Twitter and as always  thank you all so much for watching we'll  fall off
 

